WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 28=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:51.319 --> 01:53.079
I rest my head
on the pillow you slept on,

01:55.079 --> 01:57.079
sleep on the mattress you just slept on,

01:58.680 --> 02:00.519
and cover myself
with the quilt you just used.

02:02.319 --> 02:03.239
So I suppose...

02:07.040 --> 02:08.919
we've shared a bed after all.

02:12.100 --> 02:14.380
♪Your shimmering gaze♪

02:14.380 --> 02:18.460
♪Keeps stirring the tides of fate♪

02:19.700 --> 02:21.620
♪The graceful waves♪

02:21.620 --> 02:23.500
♪Sway gently to and fro♪

02:23.500 --> 02:27.380
♪Yet my heart is caught in the flurry♪

02:28.100 --> 02:30.100
♪Ooh, you fall into my heart♪

02:30.100 --> 02:34.940
♪There are still many chapters ahead♪

02:34.940 --> 02:38.479
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

02:38.479 --> 02:40.639
Nanny Zhang, wipe down the pillars, too.

02:40.759 --> 02:41.680
All right.

02:43.960 --> 02:46.199
The fallen leaves. Make sure
you sweep them up properly.

02:57.120 --> 02:59.280
Young Master had this
specially made for Young Madam.

02:59.480 --> 03:01.000
Today is your first day as a newlywed.

03:01.000 --> 03:02.180
You'll be meeting the elders.

03:02.199 --> 03:04.719
This is both elegant and dignified.

03:09.319 --> 03:10.439
It's so heavy.

03:11.256 --> 03:12.680
It'll be hard to kowtow in this.

03:18.520 --> 03:20.479
My parents had this
specially made for me.

03:20.800 --> 03:22.000
It's hollow inside.

03:23.800 --> 03:27.199
It looks beautiful and is light to wear.

03:30.199 --> 03:30.960
It looks lovely.

03:45.320 --> 03:47.230
After the Shence Garrison
winter clothing case,

03:47.240 --> 03:49.830
the late Emperor bestowed
a silver squirrel pelt on Young Master.

03:49.840 --> 03:51.700
Young Master kept it all this time
and never let anyone use it.

03:51.719 --> 03:54.240
Now he's had it specially made
into a fur coat for you.

03:54.719 --> 03:56.680
It's warm and beautiful.

04:01.590 --> 04:04.460
This is your first time paying respects
to the elders after the wedding.

04:04.472 --> 04:06.560
Would this be too plain?

04:06.856 --> 04:09.352
The silver squirrel coat
Young Master prepared would be better.

04:09.719 --> 04:10.840
I'll wear this one.

04:22.800 --> 04:24.560
This coat may look plain,

04:24.720 --> 04:27.399
but your mother sewed
every stitch of it by hand.

04:27.759 --> 04:30.199
For a daughter to wear it
is an expression of filial devotion.

04:30.216 --> 04:31.920
When Old Master
and First Madam see it,

04:31.920 --> 04:33.199
I'm sure they'll be pleased, too.

04:34.319 --> 04:35.439
Xiaolian is right.

04:37.160 --> 04:38.519
I wasn't thinking clearly.

04:44.000 --> 04:45.580
It's been over a year since we last met.

04:45.759 --> 04:47.920
Even Xiaolian is sounding
quite learned now.

04:49.959 --> 04:51.160
Yuchan has taught you well.

04:54.519 --> 04:57.079
Unfortunately, Baogai learned the most.

04:57.319 --> 04:58.560
I came second.

04:59.000 --> 05:01.160
Xiaolian did the worst.

05:28.959 --> 05:29.399
My lady.

05:30.120 --> 05:30.519
Please.

05:50.104 --> 05:51.360
What are you standing there for?

05:52.399 --> 05:53.360
Hurry and catch up.

05:57.780 --> 06:01.980
(Beyond Doubt, Steadfast in Virtue)

06:01.980 --> 06:11.100
(Spring Breeze Carries the Seasons)

06:14.399 --> 06:16.000
Why did Young Master change his clothes?

06:16.399 --> 06:19.240
He was dressed quite lavishly earlier.

06:20.008 --> 06:22.480
Young Master must have heard
what Young Madam said

06:22.480 --> 06:23.752
and changed specially for her.

06:30.808 --> 06:32.190
Did you sleep well last night?

06:35.416 --> 06:37.000
Is there anything you'd like for lunch?

06:42.199 --> 06:43.160
Don't be nervous.

06:43.240 --> 06:45.528
You're only paying respects
to the elders of the family.

06:45.832 --> 06:47.560
No one
will make things difficult for you.

06:47.560 --> 06:48.600
I'm not nervous.

06:49.048 --> 06:51.240
The imperial edict
is still kept in the family shrine.

06:53.800 --> 06:54.360
Exactly.

06:54.879 --> 06:57.160
You're the wife
I pleaded so hard to marry.

06:57.848 --> 06:59.672
If anyone dares
make things difficult for you,

06:59.768 --> 07:01.800
at the very least,
that would be disrespecting me.

07:02.000 --> 07:02.600
More seriously,

07:02.600 --> 07:04.439
it would be disrespecting
His Majesty himself.

07:06.600 --> 07:09.040
Young Master Lin, I just realized

07:09.199 --> 07:10.519
you really are shameless.

07:12.600 --> 07:13.399
Exactly.

07:14.519 --> 07:16.319
The sea winds in Jinzhou were so strong

07:16.600 --> 07:18.639
that after a few years,
they thickened my skin.

07:19.600 --> 07:20.240
It's all right.

07:20.392 --> 07:21.720
We're married now anyway.

07:21.730 --> 07:23.300
You can help me
take care of it, my lady.

07:23.310 --> 07:24.330
Give it a couple of years,

07:24.480 --> 07:25.680
and maybe it'll get thin again.

07:32.216 --> 07:34.344
You lived in the capital
when you were little, right?

07:35.480 --> 07:37.160
The capital is colder than Jinling.

07:37.399 --> 07:40.040
When it snows there,
the flakes are as big as goose feathers.

07:40.552 --> 07:41.310
Have you seen it?

07:42.160 --> 07:43.560
It gets freezing cold there.

07:43.592 --> 07:45.464
You'd have to wear two
or three padded coats.

07:58.980 --> 08:01.340
(Upholding the Virtue
of Generations Past)

08:02.199 --> 08:03.800
Young Master and Young Madam are here.

08:25.480 --> 08:27.000
I pay my respects to you, Old Master,

08:27.360 --> 08:28.079
Old Madam,

08:28.680 --> 08:29.759
and all the other elders.

08:59.360 --> 09:01.799
Even if she comes from a humble family,

09:01.919 --> 09:03.559
she should still know proper etiquette

09:03.840 --> 09:06.159
and how to address her elders.

09:12.000 --> 09:12.720
Old Madam.

09:12.720 --> 09:14.360
What you don't know, Old Madam,

09:14.920 --> 09:16.960
is that it's fashionable
in Jinling City nowadays

09:17.200 --> 09:19.720
for a new bride to say nothing
when paying her respects.

09:20.320 --> 09:21.639
Is that really so?

09:22.720 --> 09:23.519
Yes.

09:24.159 --> 09:25.000
They say

09:25.399 --> 09:27.440
the less a new bride speaks,

09:27.759 --> 09:29.919
the more prosperous
her husband's family will be.

09:33.879 --> 09:34.879
I see.

09:43.879 --> 09:45.440
Young Madam got up before dawn

09:45.440 --> 09:46.679
to make this fish soup.

10:30.120 --> 10:30.720
Grandfather,

10:31.192 --> 10:33.176
please try your
granddaughter-in-law's cooking.

11:27.559 --> 11:28.639
Lanxiang,

11:29.440 --> 11:32.120
the Lin family is a scholarly household,

11:33.080 --> 11:36.039
and you are the wife
of our eldest grandson.

11:37.399 --> 11:38.720
(Their Lin family)

11:38.879 --> 11:40.559
(is a distinguished clan in Jiangnan.)

11:40.792 --> 11:42.504
(If you marry into the family,)

11:42.679 --> 11:44.320
(you must serve your parents-in-law.)

11:44.424 --> 11:46.952
(You won't have the same freedom
you had before marriage.)

11:47.279 --> 11:49.480
Seek guidance from your elders.

11:50.039 --> 11:52.000
Don't act on your own

11:52.408 --> 11:54.200
and upset the rules of the household.

11:55.120 --> 11:57.320
(Whether you marry sooner or later,)

11:57.704 --> 11:59.870
(the Shen family
will always be there for you.)

12:08.360 --> 12:11.440
(Does the Lin family intend
to break off the engagement?)

12:11.559 --> 12:13.159
(The Lin family has gone too far!)

12:22.600 --> 12:23.910
Taking this opportunity today,

12:24.440 --> 12:25.759
I also have something

12:25.944 --> 12:27.360
to report to Grandfather

12:27.879 --> 12:28.960
and all the elders.

12:30.960 --> 12:33.279
His Majesty is currently
in need of capable men by his side

12:33.759 --> 12:35.600
and intends
to transfer me to the capital.

12:36.024 --> 12:37.390
Since I've only recently married,

12:37.759 --> 12:40.559
I had hoped to stay a little longer

12:40.840 --> 12:42.200
so my wife could also

12:42.312 --> 12:44.536
spend more time
showing her devotion to the elders.

12:44.759 --> 12:47.759
But the canal will freeze over
by the end of November,

12:48.159 --> 12:50.320
and the cold
has come especially early this year.

12:50.679 --> 12:52.960
So I have no choice
but to leave ahead of schedule

12:53.032 --> 12:54.552
to take up my post in the capital.

12:54.759 --> 12:56.000
You're going to the capital?

12:56.568 --> 12:58.320
Going to the capital is a good thing.

12:59.360 --> 13:02.200
His Majesty intends to entrust you
with important duties.

13:02.720 --> 13:03.799
Good.

13:03.799 --> 13:06.000
Our Lin family is finally on the rise.

13:10.120 --> 13:12.120
Do you have to rush
to the capital right now?

13:14.320 --> 13:16.279
Why not wait until
after the Chinese New Year

13:16.799 --> 13:18.320
and leave when the weather warms up?

13:19.840 --> 13:22.679
You women are always so short-sighted.

13:23.320 --> 13:25.360
The capital is where
the Emperor resides.

13:26.120 --> 13:27.480
Countless people would do anything

13:27.480 --> 13:29.159
to get in, yet never get the chance.

13:31.519 --> 13:33.279
You're talking
about yourself, aren't you?

13:33.919 --> 13:34.600
Changmin.

13:35.240 --> 13:36.919
Don't provoke me today.

13:37.159 --> 13:38.320
How did I provoke you?

13:38.320 --> 13:39.080
That's enough.

13:39.279 --> 13:40.919
What do you mean by that?

13:46.759 --> 13:47.759
Are you planning

13:48.200 --> 13:50.759
to take your wife
to the capital with you?

13:52.504 --> 13:54.056
Judging by His Majesty's intentions,

13:54.376 --> 13:56.390
I'm afraid I won't be back
for two or three years.

13:58.519 --> 14:00.759
Of course I'll take my wife with me

14:01.000 --> 14:02.360
so we can look after each other.

14:23.759 --> 14:26.240
Why does Old Master look unhappy?

14:27.320 --> 14:28.879
What nonsense are you talking about?

14:29.120 --> 14:30.799
Old Master is simply too happy

14:30.799 --> 14:32.399
to find the words.

14:34.159 --> 14:35.600
What do you know?

14:35.864 --> 14:37.870
If he wants to become
an important court official

14:38.240 --> 14:39.720
and one of His Majesty's trusted men,

14:40.240 --> 14:43.399
he must first enter the imperial court
and be close to His Majesty.

14:43.559 --> 14:44.200
But right now,

14:44.720 --> 14:48.120
where are the imperial court
and His Majesty? In the capital.

14:49.840 --> 14:52.399
Jinqi, what are you
still standing there for?

14:52.400 --> 14:53.480
Hurry and pack your things

14:53.480 --> 14:55.176
and get ready to leave for the capital.

14:56.679 --> 14:57.360
Yes.

15:15.919 --> 15:17.600
There's no need to unpack the dowry.

15:17.960 --> 15:19.559
We can take it straight to the capital.

15:22.792 --> 15:24.550
His Majesty summoned you to the capital,

15:24.720 --> 15:25.799
not me.

15:26.519 --> 15:27.480
I'll stay in Jinling

15:27.480 --> 15:29.559
to care for our parents
and serve the elders.

15:32.360 --> 15:33.600
I'm going to the capital

15:34.720 --> 15:36.159
not only for my official career,

15:37.320 --> 15:38.519
but also for you.

15:41.960 --> 15:43.559
Don't try to sweet-talk me.

15:48.159 --> 15:49.600
I'm not even in the capital,

15:49.720 --> 15:51.944
so there's no need for you
to go there for my sake.

15:54.519 --> 15:56.600
Now that we're husband and wife,

15:56.664 --> 15:58.150
we'll share both fortune and hardship.

15:59.159 --> 16:01.159
So I'll be completely frank with you.

16:02.559 --> 16:04.960
Old Madam, Father, and Uncle Changmin

16:05.279 --> 16:07.000
are all unreasonable and muddleheaded.

16:09.240 --> 16:10.399
Grandfather and Mother

16:10.879 --> 16:11.799
are shrewd,

16:12.480 --> 16:13.519
but in recent years,

16:13.544 --> 16:15.304
they've become
increasingly difficult too.

16:15.528 --> 16:18.670
Aunt Lingxiao is clever in small matters
but foolish about important ones.

16:18.960 --> 16:20.399
She's as close to Mother as a sister.

16:21.032 --> 16:22.870
When Mother strikes,
she hands her the rod.

16:22.870 --> 16:25.208
All she does is fan the flames
and make things worse.

16:26.759 --> 16:29.080
You saw what happened this morning.

16:29.320 --> 16:30.759
Because of our marriage,

16:30.824 --> 16:33.000
they're all harboring
a great deal of resentment.

16:33.720 --> 16:35.320
I'm out from morning till night,

16:35.330 --> 16:37.100
so they can't
make things difficult for me.

16:37.256 --> 16:38.750
But you'll be here in the residence.

16:39.336 --> 16:41.320
Even with the imperial edict
to protect you,

16:41.528 --> 16:44.568
it can only protect you from what
happens openly, not in secret.

16:45.440 --> 16:48.159
Rather than endure their constant
nagging here every day,

16:48.679 --> 16:50.159
we might as well leave altogether.

16:50.720 --> 16:52.120
Out of sight, out of mind for them,

16:52.159 --> 16:53.440
and we'll be happier, too.

16:53.919 --> 16:55.080
After three or five years,

16:55.080 --> 16:56.840
once we've settled
into life in the capital,

16:56.960 --> 16:58.399
their anger will have subsided, too.

17:00.320 --> 17:01.480
You can go if you want.

17:01.919 --> 17:03.480
I'm not going to the capital anyway.

17:06.079 --> 17:08.319
You're worried
about your parents, aren't you?

17:09.200 --> 17:10.000
Don't worry.

17:10.359 --> 17:11.599
I'll make sure some friends

17:11.599 --> 17:13.319
visit them every few days

17:13.319 --> 17:14.160
and look after them.

17:18.072 --> 17:19.680
Are you worried that in the capital,

17:19.720 --> 17:21.496
you won't know anyone
or your way around?

17:21.736 --> 17:23.384
Xiaolian, Yuchan, Gantang, and Baogai

17:23.432 --> 17:24.750
will come to the capital with us.

17:24.824 --> 17:26.296
Whoever you want, we'll bring along.

17:37.440 --> 17:38.839
Is there someone you can't bear

17:39.960 --> 17:41.279
to leave behind in Jinling City?

17:46.504 --> 17:49.592
Scholar Han will be taking the
metropolitan examination next spring,

17:55.336 --> 17:56.920
so he'll be going to the capital, too.

17:59.720 --> 18:01.400
What nonsense are you talking about?

18:07.224 --> 18:09.400
You've had
a few years of schooling, at least.

18:09.432 --> 18:11.180
How did you sound
just like a crude soldier,

18:11.192 --> 18:12.376
spouting such nonsense?

18:12.408 --> 18:14.160
Even if you don't care
about my reputation,

18:14.240 --> 18:15.680
you should at least care about his.

18:20.296 --> 18:22.000
My mother-in-law
made these clothes for me?

18:22.536 --> 18:24.160
Why didn't you give them to me sooner?

18:27.519 --> 18:28.319
Give it back.

18:28.559 --> 18:29.480
This was made for me.

18:29.480 --> 18:30.240
Give it back.

18:30.680 --> 18:31.720
Don't tear it.

18:31.720 --> 18:32.599
Give it back to me.

18:32.600 --> 18:33.800
Stop pulling. You'll ruin it!

18:54.100 --> 18:56.020
♪A faint trace of fragrance♪

18:56.020 --> 18:57.860
♪Softly lingers in the air♪

19:00.000 --> 19:01.599
If there's no one else on your mind,

19:02.759 --> 19:04.160
then come to the capital with me.

19:05.624 --> 19:07.310
Why should I have to prove my innocence?

19:08.440 --> 19:10.279
Believe whatever you want.

19:10.279 --> 19:11.359
But Young Master Lin,

19:11.624 --> 19:13.880
I may come from a humble family
and be at your mercy,

19:14.120 --> 19:16.590
but slandering an imperial official
could land you in court.

19:18.580 --> 19:20.100
♪Ooh, you fall into my heart♪

19:20.100 --> 19:25.020
♪There are still many chapters ahead♪

19:26.020 --> 19:28.140
♪Ooh, I can't forget♪

19:28.140 --> 19:29.980
♪My longing fills my eyes♪

19:29.980 --> 19:33.180
♪My longing lingers
like the fragrance of orchids♪

19:34.180 --> 19:36.820
♪Ooh, I've walked through
frost-covered streets far and wide♪

19:37.820 --> 19:40.740
♪Ooh, I'm blessed to have you
understand my tender heart♪

19:43.400 --> 19:44.039
My lady.

19:45.240 --> 19:45.839
My lady.

19:47.039 --> 19:48.000
I was wrong.

19:48.759 --> 19:50.240
I won't speak such nonsense again.

19:50.240 --> 19:52.420
♪Love lingers all around us♪

19:53.580 --> 19:55.660
♪Holding hands through this life♪

19:55.660 --> 20:03.340
♪Breathing in the fragrance
that fills the courtyard♪

20:45.920 --> 20:48.559
Jinqiao's wedding is set for next May.

20:48.920 --> 20:50.200
Originally, I thought

20:50.200 --> 20:52.920
we'd wait until spring before going
to the capital for the wedding.

20:53.880 --> 20:54.759
But now,

20:54.759 --> 20:57.319
Jinqi happens to be going
to the capital to take up his post.

20:57.680 --> 20:58.559
So I thought

20:58.616 --> 21:00.440
they could travel
to the capital together

21:01.039 --> 21:03.279
and look out for each other.

21:06.440 --> 21:07.160
That works.

21:07.920 --> 21:09.160
Make your preparations

21:09.160 --> 21:12.319
and go to the capital with your brother.

21:13.039 --> 21:13.680
Yes.

21:15.519 --> 21:18.200
Jinqiao is still too playful.
Just look at him.

21:18.200 --> 21:20.559
He even fell off his horse while riding.

21:22.079 --> 21:25.240
His future wife is still young
and can't handle much yet.

21:25.559 --> 21:26.559
So I thought

21:27.240 --> 21:29.319
I'd accompany Jinqiao to the capital

21:30.056 --> 21:31.944
and make sure
the wedding is properly arranged,

21:31.960 --> 21:34.480
so both the Lin and Cheng families
can hold their heads high.

21:37.960 --> 21:38.559
All right.

21:39.079 --> 21:39.880
You may go.

21:41.319 --> 21:42.559
You're not young anymore.

21:42.560 --> 21:44.376
It's time you took on
some responsibility.

21:44.799 --> 21:47.039
Don't rely on
your brother for everything.

21:47.599 --> 21:49.119
Take good care of your mother.

21:50.039 --> 21:52.160
I will remember
your teachings, Grandfather.

22:03.480 --> 22:05.359
Grand... Grandfather.

22:05.960 --> 22:06.799
Well...

22:07.920 --> 22:09.880
Xiuwan has been confined
for over a year now.

22:10.030 --> 22:12.088
Keeping her locked away
like this isn't a solution.

22:12.400 --> 22:13.559
Mother was thinking

22:13.559 --> 22:15.359
of taking Xiuwan to the capital with us

22:15.720 --> 22:17.759
and asking Aunt for help.

22:17.920 --> 22:19.799
Perhaps she can find her
a suitable match.

22:21.119 --> 22:23.599
Xiuwan truly knows she was wrong.

22:24.079 --> 22:26.000
Another year is nearly gone.

22:28.640 --> 22:30.000
If this drags on any longer,

22:30.376 --> 22:32.440
she really won't be able
to find a suitable match.

22:34.680 --> 22:36.440
You welcomed the bride in April,

22:36.799 --> 22:38.400
so you'll have to hurry back soon after.

22:39.119 --> 22:40.279
At most,

22:40.599 --> 22:43.319
you'll only be
in the capital for five months,

22:43.480 --> 22:46.319
and you'll have Jinqiao's
wedding to prepare for.

22:46.440 --> 22:49.559
How could you find her
a good match in such a rush?

22:50.880 --> 22:52.480
Stay home and behave yourself.

22:53.759 --> 22:54.839
Old Master,

22:55.079 --> 22:56.759
she's my only daughter.

22:56.808 --> 22:58.470
As long as things
aren't settled for her,

22:58.559 --> 23:01.079
I won't have a day of peace.

23:02.640 --> 23:04.200
Xiuwan has been confined for so long

23:04.210 --> 23:05.300
and has stayed in her room

23:05.310 --> 23:07.288
studying earnestly
and reflecting on her mistakes.

23:08.200 --> 23:10.039
She truly knows she was wrong.

23:10.160 --> 23:11.359
For the sake of

23:11.759 --> 23:14.079
how long she's been kneeling outside,

23:14.640 --> 23:16.640
please let her
go to the capital with us.

23:19.336 --> 23:20.000
Young Master.

23:25.640 --> 23:26.599
Jinqi.

23:39.359 --> 23:41.079
Your Lordship, Third Young Lady.

24:08.200 --> 24:09.000
Xiuwan.

24:21.279 --> 24:23.519
This is my second younger sister.

24:23.880 --> 24:25.270
She's the most mischievous of us all

24:26.184 --> 24:28.120
and has been made
to kneel by Grandfather again.

24:30.480 --> 24:32.680
And this is my third brother-in-law.

24:35.544 --> 24:37.416
I hope you've been well
this winter, Xiuwan.

25:02.376 --> 25:04.584
I hope you've been well
this winter, Chengze.

25:14.279 --> 25:15.559
It's freezing out here.

25:15.880 --> 25:16.920
How can your knees

25:17.319 --> 25:18.559
take all this kneeling?

25:20.559 --> 25:21.559
I'm not foolish.

25:22.319 --> 25:23.920
I'm wearing wool knee pads.

25:27.960 --> 25:29.319
You're with child.

25:30.359 --> 25:32.119
Don't stand out here
in the cold with me.

25:32.839 --> 25:33.960
Hurry inside.

25:34.616 --> 25:36.936
And put in a good word
for me while you're there.

25:43.048 --> 25:45.736
Young Master, Third Son-in-Law
and Third Young Lady are here.

25:47.759 --> 25:48.519
Chengze.

25:50.400 --> 25:52.039
Using me as an excuse again.

26:28.759 --> 26:29.720
Jinqi.

26:32.720 --> 26:34.640
Is this the test you were talking about?

26:41.200 --> 26:43.240
So have I passed your test?

26:46.519 --> 26:47.400
You have.

26:50.640 --> 26:52.039
I'll take you to the capital.

26:53.320 --> 26:54.920
Whether or not we find you a match,

26:55.448 --> 26:57.030
you should broaden your horizons first.

26:57.960 --> 26:59.440
Once you've seen more of the world,

27:00.008 --> 27:01.400
your world will naturally open up.

27:02.920 --> 27:04.359
Then you'll be able to put the past

27:05.039 --> 27:06.599
behind you like we have,

27:06.824 --> 27:09.224
instead of forcing yourself
to act strong like you are now.

27:23.400 --> 27:24.519
Wipe away your tears.

27:25.288 --> 27:26.480
Hold on a little longer.

27:27.048 --> 27:28.720
You won't have to kneel much longer.

27:29.848 --> 27:31.640
Thank you for your concern, Grandfather.

27:31.880 --> 27:34.184
Mother has taken her medicine
and isn't coughing anymore.

27:36.240 --> 27:37.119
That's good.

27:37.519 --> 27:38.359
That's good.

27:44.240 --> 27:44.839
Jinqi.

27:48.799 --> 27:49.400
Grandfather.

27:50.839 --> 27:52.400
Jinqiao and I have discussed it.

27:52.744 --> 27:54.400
Since we're both going to the capital,

27:54.640 --> 27:55.359
we can also take

27:55.480 --> 27:57.480
Aunt Lingxiao and Xiuwan
to visit their family.

27:58.840 --> 28:00.920
Please give us
your permission, Grandfather.

28:22.640 --> 28:23.359
All right.

28:24.839 --> 28:26.440
If you travel together,

28:26.680 --> 28:28.200
you can look out for one another.

28:28.880 --> 28:31.519
Then you can all
go to the capital together.

28:34.000 --> 28:36.559
Thank you, Old Master.

28:39.920 --> 28:40.880
Xiuwan.

28:42.720 --> 28:44.039
Xiuwan!

28:44.039 --> 28:45.759
Your grandfather agreed. He agreed!

28:45.759 --> 28:46.519
Get up.

28:46.519 --> 28:48.039
Come on. Hurry, get up.

28:51.200 --> 28:52.359
Here, slowly.

28:52.616 --> 28:54.550
You've been kneeling
a long time, haven't you?

28:54.720 --> 28:55.759
Come on, let's go.

28:55.920 --> 28:58.519
Let's go back and pack
your clothes and jewelry.

28:59.759 --> 29:00.960
Once we reach the capital,

29:01.480 --> 29:03.160
I'll make sure to find you a good match.

29:03.304 --> 29:05.400
The most important thing
is that you're close in age

29:05.448 --> 29:06.960
and can be each other's first spouse.

29:07.240 --> 29:08.000
Look at Xiuru.

29:08.400 --> 29:10.480
What's so good about
becoming someone's second wife?

29:10.520 --> 29:11.720
No matter how noble his status,

29:11.960 --> 29:13.400
he's still an older widower

29:13.920 --> 29:15.359
with a child.

29:15.360 --> 29:17.496
She has to become a mother
the moment she marries him.

29:17.559 --> 29:19.500
If she does well,
it's only considered her duty.

29:19.519 --> 29:21.319
If she doesn't, it'll all be her fault.

29:28.359 --> 29:29.279
What's wrong, Xiuwan?

29:33.519 --> 29:35.799
Xiuru and her husband
have both let it go.

29:37.160 --> 29:38.759
You should let it go too, Mother.

29:46.240 --> 29:48.119
It's my fault.

29:52.960 --> 29:54.599
I just saw Xiuru

29:57.319 --> 29:58.680
dressed in all her finery,

29:58.960 --> 30:00.200
looking so radiant,

30:02.240 --> 30:03.319
and your grandfather

30:04.000 --> 30:06.400
treating her with
such courtesy and respect.

30:09.240 --> 30:10.759
I got petty again.

30:11.319 --> 30:13.440
I couldn't help feeling bitter.

30:15.784 --> 30:17.976
Think about it.
Ever since you were little,

30:18.200 --> 30:20.119
you were always the one
who shone the brightest.

30:20.359 --> 30:21.799
When was it ever her turn?

30:26.079 --> 30:27.400
That's because I have you, Mother.

30:28.960 --> 30:30.480
No matter how well Xiuru is married,

30:31.000 --> 30:32.200
I'm not envious of her.

30:33.559 --> 30:35.200
I have a mother who loves me.

30:36.039 --> 30:37.119
That alone

30:37.720 --> 30:40.359
is worth more than any good marriage.

30:47.039 --> 30:48.200
Silly girl.

30:51.559 --> 30:53.440
I can't take care of you forever.

30:56.319 --> 30:58.160
You'll have to marry someday.

30:59.920 --> 31:01.039
Then I won't marry.

31:01.680 --> 31:02.839
I'll stay by your side

31:03.240 --> 31:04.720
and let you love me forever.

31:10.400 --> 31:12.480
You... You're a grown lady now,

31:12.839 --> 31:14.440
yet you're still talking like a child.

31:20.480 --> 31:21.200
Are you cold?

31:22.279 --> 31:22.839
No.

31:24.400 --> 31:25.000
Let's go.

31:26.279 --> 31:26.680
Let's go.

31:30.799 --> 31:32.799
Think about which pretty clothes
you want to bring

31:32.920 --> 31:34.119
and pack them all up.

31:38.599 --> 31:40.440
It's still a little chilly.

31:41.000 --> 31:43.599
I told you to put on another layer,
but you wouldn't listen.

31:44.680 --> 31:45.440
It's all right.

31:46.400 --> 31:47.559
We'll be back soon anyway.

31:53.319 --> 31:54.640
Jinlan, Suhua.

31:57.144 --> 31:58.790
- Aunt Lingxiao.
- Aunt Lingxiao.

31:58.920 --> 32:00.184
- Xiuwan.
- Xiuwan.

32:01.039 --> 32:02.400
It's freezing out here.

32:02.759 --> 32:05.119
You know Jinlan is frail
and shouldn't be out in the cold,

32:05.208 --> 32:07.030
yet you still let him
wander around outside.

32:08.039 --> 32:09.279
If he falls ill,

32:09.519 --> 32:11.920
I'd like to see how you explain it
to Master and First Madam.

32:13.680 --> 32:14.920
Jinqi and I agreed

32:15.016 --> 32:16.480
to pay our respects to Grandfather.

32:17.192 --> 32:19.200
She was worried about me,
so she followed me out.

32:19.880 --> 32:21.559
Jinlan isn't a child anymore.

32:21.592 --> 32:24.536
What does his coming out for a stroll
have to do with Sister-in-Law?

32:25.079 --> 32:26.000
Besides,

32:26.200 --> 32:28.359
look how warmly she's dressed Jinlan.

32:28.360 --> 32:31.064
He's not going to fall ill
from a little wind that easily.

32:32.640 --> 32:33.960
I can't win an argument with you.

32:34.799 --> 32:35.880
I'm done talking to you.

32:42.744 --> 32:44.856
Grandfather agreed
to let you go to the capital?

32:48.519 --> 32:50.079
What are you waiting for? Hurry up.

32:50.559 --> 32:51.359
Coming.

32:53.440 --> 32:55.160
Jinlan, go on.

32:56.070 --> 32:58.376
With Jinqi, Xiuru,
and her husband's help,

32:58.408 --> 33:01.720
I'm sure you'll get your wish
and be able to take Sister-in-Law

33:01.720 --> 33:02.759
to the capital with you.

33:14.960 --> 33:15.599
What?

33:16.079 --> 33:18.160
You're planning
to take Jinlan and his wife

33:18.279 --> 33:20.000
to the capital too?

33:20.680 --> 33:21.920
Ever since he was little,

33:22.119 --> 33:23.480
Jinlan has never left Jinling.

33:23.920 --> 33:24.960
He's read countless books,

33:25.064 --> 33:26.984
but never had the chance
to see the world.

33:27.048 --> 33:28.720
He's bound to have regrets about that.

33:31.160 --> 33:33.976
Traveling across the great mountains
and rivers is out of the question,

33:34.440 --> 33:35.640
but the capital

33:35.688 --> 33:37.688
is somewhere
he should see at least once.

33:38.696 --> 33:40.640
Now that he'll
have elders traveling with him

33:40.839 --> 33:42.160
and his brothers by his side,

33:42.360 --> 33:44.664
it's the perfect chance for him
to see more of the world.

33:47.200 --> 33:50.279
With his health,
as long as he stays alive

33:50.680 --> 33:52.480
and has a child or two,

33:52.680 --> 33:53.599
that's enough.

33:54.160 --> 33:54.759
This family

33:55.200 --> 33:57.559
doesn't need him
to broaden his horizons.

34:00.400 --> 34:01.119
Jinlan

34:02.440 --> 34:03.599
needs it for himself.

34:18.199 --> 34:19.559
Jinlan takes after Grandfather.

34:19.640 --> 34:21.030
He's intelligent and eager to learn.

34:21.640 --> 34:23.710
If his health hadn't
kept him confined at home,

34:23.760 --> 34:25.896
he surely would have
accomplished great things, too.

34:26.280 --> 34:27.320
For a man,

34:27.368 --> 34:28.760
sometimes keeping one's spirit alive

34:29.119 --> 34:30.679
matters more than merely staying alive.

34:35.000 --> 34:35.599
Grandfather.

34:36.168 --> 34:38.472
There are many renowned physicians
in the capital.

34:38.664 --> 34:40.190
I was thinking that on this trip,

34:40.264 --> 34:42.104
we could also seek
medical treatment for him.

34:42.320 --> 34:44.760
Perhaps this could be
a turning point for Jinlan

34:45.039 --> 34:46.280
and his health might improve.

34:47.519 --> 34:48.599
Jinqi is right.

34:49.239 --> 34:50.480
Once Jinqi takes up his post,

34:50.510 --> 34:52.250
I'll go with Jinlan
to see the physicians.

34:52.840 --> 34:53.880
Don't worry, Grandfather.

34:54.039 --> 34:55.920
We'll make sure Jinlan
is well taken care of.

35:02.440 --> 35:05.208
Second Young Master
and Second Young Madam are here.

35:10.280 --> 35:11.440
- Grandfather.
- Grandfather.

35:28.079 --> 35:29.599
I can see what's going on now.

35:29.760 --> 35:32.519
You brothers planned this long ago

35:32.760 --> 35:34.960
and already made up
your minds, didn't you?

35:41.159 --> 35:42.639
Nothing escapes you, Grandfather.

35:47.559 --> 35:48.880
I'm an only son.

35:49.519 --> 35:50.480
I truly envy them.

35:50.824 --> 35:53.150
The sisters are close,
and the brothers stand together.

35:55.360 --> 35:57.199
Now that we're all family,

35:57.440 --> 35:59.199
you're their brother, too.

36:00.320 --> 36:01.400
You're right, Grandfather.

36:02.519 --> 36:03.199
Grandfather.

36:03.599 --> 36:05.480
Does that mean
you'll let Jinlan come with us?

36:11.960 --> 36:12.639
Go.

36:15.000 --> 36:16.199
With all of you gone,

36:16.400 --> 36:18.079
we'll enjoy some peace and quiet.

36:25.016 --> 36:27.272
- Thank you, Grandfather.
- Thank you, Grandfather.

36:31.000 --> 36:32.039
Jinqi, this is wonderful!

36:47.030 --> 36:47.784
Come, take a look!

36:47.816 --> 36:50.320
Silk flowers from the capital!
Young Lady, come have a look.

36:50.392 --> 36:52.104
Even the ladies of the palace love them.

36:55.256 --> 36:56.168
Young Lady...

36:57.760 --> 36:58.360
Here.

37:12.679 --> 37:13.719
This one is pretty.

37:15.368 --> 37:16.760
Or does this one look better?

37:18.800 --> 37:20.679
Look at me.

37:26.400 --> 37:27.400
Then it's settled. I'll

37:27.519 --> 37:29.559
(Ling Silk Shop)
ask a matchmaker to visit your family.

37:29.559 --> 37:30.440
Good.

37:36.519 --> 37:38.519
Isn't that your son, Lin Jiugao?

37:38.520 --> 37:39.912
You're not looking at me, are you?

37:41.800 --> 37:42.760
Go.

37:46.639 --> 37:47.880
Hurry and look. Isn't that him?

37:48.559 --> 37:48.960
No.

37:49.519 --> 37:51.840
Absolutely not. You've got
the wrong person. Let's go.

37:51.840 --> 37:53.639
How... How could that not be him?

37:56.199 --> 37:57.000
Lin Jiugao?

37:59.599 --> 38:02.880
Auntie...

38:05.352 --> 38:06.400
Come with me. Let's go.

38:06.400 --> 38:08.000
Please, don't be angry.

38:08.599 --> 38:10.000
Wu Suan'er!

38:10.199 --> 38:11.760
I must've been blind

38:11.760 --> 38:13.599
to ever associate
with a scoundrel like you!

38:13.880 --> 38:15.800
Listen, that little rascal

38:15.880 --> 38:17.679
is full of tricks.

38:17.800 --> 38:19.119
He... He must be

38:19.119 --> 38:20.800
putting on another act to fool people.

38:20.800 --> 38:22.480
Don't even think about fooling us.

38:22.880 --> 38:24.519
With a son like yours,

38:24.550 --> 38:26.808
don't let him ruin
some innocent young lady's life.

38:27.719 --> 38:29.760
Come on, girl. Let's go.

38:29.920 --> 38:32.079
Sister! Wait!

38:48.480 --> 38:49.800
Neither of you is any good.

38:51.519 --> 38:52.800
Neither of you.

39:07.039 --> 39:08.039
Since we're already here,

39:08.679 --> 39:10.840
I'll pick out a couple
of silk flowers for Yuchan.

39:12.719 --> 39:14.119
If you want to marry Yuchan,

39:14.199 --> 39:15.360
just tell Madam Wu directly.

39:15.400 --> 39:17.000
Why deliberately make your mother angry?

39:17.639 --> 39:19.280
My mother has very high expectations.

39:19.600 --> 39:22.630
She thinks that since I started serving
Young Master, my prospects have changed

39:22.648 --> 39:24.190
and I have a bright future ahead of me.

39:24.720 --> 39:27.096
She's only been looking
at girls from free commoner families

39:27.100 --> 39:28.890
and won't even
consider military households.

39:29.016 --> 39:32.040
Then why not ask Young Master to seek
an imperial marriage decree for you?

39:33.320 --> 39:34.280
I originally

39:34.840 --> 39:36.199
had the same idea.

39:36.488 --> 39:38.360
I'm sure Young Master would gladly help.

39:43.800 --> 39:44.559
But...

39:52.008 --> 39:53.352
You weren't there when everyone

39:53.800 --> 39:55.560
went to have some fun
with the newlyweds.

39:56.679 --> 39:58.639
You didn't see Young Madam
hit Young Master.

39:58.808 --> 40:00.856
I don't know
if it knocked any sense into him,

40:01.032 --> 40:02.840
but it certainly knocked
some sense into me.

40:03.688 --> 40:06.630
I know full well my mother doesn't
want Yuchan as her daughter-in-law.

40:07.079 --> 40:08.599
If I insist on marrying her anyway,

40:09.400 --> 40:10.840
they'll never get along,

40:10.936 --> 40:13.000
and Yuchan will constantly
be caught in the middle.

40:13.112 --> 40:14.824
Why would I put her through that?

40:17.599 --> 40:18.119
All right.

40:18.480 --> 40:19.000
Thank you.

40:19.000 --> 40:19.639
Take care.

40:21.239 --> 40:22.000
We're off.

40:24.600 --> 40:25.800
Since you've already given up,

40:25.800 --> 40:26.880
why put on that whole act?

40:28.000 --> 40:29.400
Who says I've given up?

40:29.800 --> 40:33.360
I'm planning to hold out against
my mother to the very end.

40:36.239 --> 40:37.639
Is this a man or a woman?

40:38.559 --> 40:39.480
Here in Jinling City,

40:39.560 --> 40:41.590
my mother can forget
about finding me a wife now.

40:42.639 --> 40:43.960
Is this a man or a woman?

40:44.320 --> 40:45.119
Looking like this...

40:46.159 --> 40:46.800
What's wrong?

40:53.599 --> 40:55.760
We're leaving
for the capital soon. Don't worry.

40:57.039 --> 40:59.519
It doesn't matter
if you can't find a wife in Jinling.

41:04.760 --> 41:09.039
I went to such lengths
to find him the perfect wife.

41:09.280 --> 41:10.599
I had everything all settled,

41:10.800 --> 41:12.440
with the prize practically in my hands,

41:13.039 --> 41:14.840
and just like that,

41:15.320 --> 41:16.856
it slipped right through my fingers

41:16.904 --> 41:19.510
before my very eyes.

41:24.199 --> 41:27.039
Who did I go to all that trouble for?

41:28.039 --> 41:30.360
Not only does he
not appreciate it at all,

41:30.639 --> 41:32.199
but he's also full of schemes

41:32.400 --> 41:34.360
and uses every one of them to fool me.

41:35.400 --> 41:39.079
He has no idea how much
I'm suffering inside.

41:42.320 --> 41:44.000
I've always prided myself
on being strong,

41:45.199 --> 41:46.920
yet I've become a laughingstock,

41:47.760 --> 41:49.800
with people gossiping about me.

41:50.559 --> 41:52.119
The old saying is right.

41:53.039 --> 41:54.079
A mother's heart

41:54.559 --> 41:55.800
is always with her child,

41:56.079 --> 41:57.440
but her child's heart

41:58.039 --> 41:59.360
is as cold as stone.

42:06.960 --> 42:08.559
A mother can't control her grown son.

42:09.840 --> 42:12.400
Try to look on the bright side.

42:13.519 --> 42:14.280
Jiugao

42:15.320 --> 42:17.039
just doesn't want to marry.

42:17.880 --> 42:18.599
At least

42:18.984 --> 42:21.190
he hasn't brought some
unreliable person into the family

42:21.440 --> 42:24.199
to stand before you every day
and make your life miserable.

42:24.599 --> 42:25.559
First Madam is busy,

42:27.480 --> 42:28.679
so I won't go in.

42:29.440 --> 42:30.320
I'm fine now.

42:30.840 --> 42:32.119
Don't let it weigh on you.

42:33.239 --> 42:33.960
Don't.

42:34.119 --> 42:35.199
Lanxiang. Lan...

42:35.199 --> 42:35.760
All right.

42:36.616 --> 42:39.190
Tell First Madam later that Young Madam
came to pay her respects,

42:39.199 --> 42:41.140
but you stopped her
and wouldn't even let her come near.

42:41.159 --> 42:41.639
Understood.

42:42.920 --> 42:43.440
Lanxiang.

42:47.559 --> 42:48.360
Are you angry?

42:52.760 --> 42:54.150
Mother was only saying a few things

42:54.150 --> 42:55.256
to Madam Wu in passing...

43:00.312 --> 43:01.784
Don't take them seriously.

43:05.220 --> 43:07.380
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:10.480 --> 43:12.159
Are you cold, Young Master?

43:13.400 --> 43:14.199
No.

43:19.480 --> 43:20.480
Bring me the cloak.

43:21.239 --> 43:22.000
No need.

43:22.168 --> 43:24.600
Those of us trained in martial arts
aren't afraid of the cold.

43:38.239 --> 43:39.239
Now that you mention it,

43:39.880 --> 43:41.239
I am feeling a little cold.

43:56.620 --> 44:00.740
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:03.580 --> 44:08.100
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:09.380 --> 44:13.300
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:13.980 --> 44:16.740
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:17.460 --> 44:19.780
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:19.780 --> 44:22.860
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:24.380 --> 44:28.620
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:31.540 --> 44:35.700
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:37.500 --> 44:41.060
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:41.060 --> 44:44.620
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:45.420 --> 44:51.100
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:51.460 --> 44:55.780
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:56.140 --> 44:59.100
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

44:59.100 --> 45:02.860
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:02.860 --> 45:05.740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:05.740 --> 45:09.820
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:09.820 --> 45:13.180
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:13.180 --> 45:16.940
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:16.940 --> 45:20.940
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:21.700 --> 45:25.860
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:25.860 --> 45:29.300
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:29.300 --> 45:32.940
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:32.940 --> 45:35.820
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:35.820 --> 45:39.900
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:39.900 --> 45:43.260
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:43.260 --> 45:46.900
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:46.900 --> 45:54.700
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
